---
pagination:
  data: languages
  size: 1
  alias: l
permalink: "{{ l.root }}index.html"
---
{#-
  Home page of lernapps.net; CSS is generated by UnoCSS at build time (uno.config.js), plus home.css for the gallery, the
  highlighter and the red ticks. One calm story, the value first and the details on the pages behind it: the promise
  (learning apps with no strings attached), a gallery of real apps from the catalog (examples), what teachers and
  parents get, the learner's own tutor (one sentence, the details on tutor.njk), a foundation for makers (including how
  to join), why another platform (it belongs to no company) and a person behind it. Details live on the features page
  (features.njk), the tutor page (tutor.njk) and the about page (about.njk). Each section has a heading, a sentence of
  value and at most one link at its end. Static HTML; the only scripts are the usage counter of the platform sites (once
  it is on: _includes/counter.njk) and cat.js, a small joke in the hero (the page is complete without it).

  Texts: landing in src/_data/de.js and en.js (one page per language, see languages.js). No copy in this file. A word
  in [[double brackets]] in a heading gets the highlighter (filter "marked").
-#}
{%- set L = l.t.landing -%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ l.code }}">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="referrer" content="strict-origin-when-cross-origin">
  <title>{{ l.t.meta.title }}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ l.t.meta.description }}">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://lernapps.net/{{ l.root }}">
  {%- if site.preview %}
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  {%- endif %}
  {% laHead page.url %}
  {%- include "counter.njk" %}
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/uno.css' | own }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/home.css' | own }}">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-slate-900 text-white" style="font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;">
  {% laHeader page.url %}

  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="outline-none">

    {# ══════ 1 HERO — the promise ══════ #}
    {#- The cat video: a button opens it in a dialog (cat.js). Nothing of it loads before the click. Without JavaScript the
        poster links to the video file; its alt text describes the scene. #}
    {%- set H = L.hero %}
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 48px 48px;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 sm:py-32 w-full flex flex-col">
        <h1 class="font-extrabold leading-none tracking-tight text-white mb-4 sm:mb-6" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);">{{ H.headline | marked | safe }}</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 sm:mb-8 max-w-2xl" style="font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2.2vw, 1.375rem); line-height: 1.5;">{{ H.subtitle }}</p>
        {#- On a phone the buttons take two rows (two buttons, then the cat button) and come first, so that the cat button is in view; the badges follow. #}
        <ul class="order-last sm:order-none flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 list-none p-0 m-0 mt-8 sm:mt-0 sm:mb-10 text-sm text-slate-300">
          {%- for b in H.badges %}
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 13 C5 14.5 7 17.5 8.5 21 C11 12 16 6 22 3"/></svg>{{ b }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="{{ H.primaryHref | own }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 sm:px-7 py-3 sm:py-3.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors">{{ H.primary }} →</a>
          <a href="{{ H.secondaryHref }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 sm:px-7 py-3 sm:py-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 text-white font-semibold hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-200 transition-colors">{{ H.secondary }}</a>
          <button type="button" hidden data-cat-open class="basis-full sm:basis-auto justify-center inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 sm:px-7 py-3 sm:py-3.5 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-slate-500 text-slate-200 font-semibold hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer bg-transparent"><span aria-hidden="true">🐱</span> {{ H.cat.open }}</button>
        </div>
        <noscript>
          <a href="{{ '/media/katze.mp4' | own }}" class="mt-6 inline-block max-w-xs rounded-xl border border-dashed border-slate-500 p-2 text-sm text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-400">
            <img src="{{ '/media/katze-poster.jpg' | own }}" alt="{{ H.cat.description }}" width="960" height="528" class="block w-full rounded-lg mb-2">
            🐱 {{ H.cat.open }}
          </a>
        </noscript>
      </div>
    </section>

    <dialog data-cat aria-label="{{ H.cat.label }}" class="m-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-3xl rounded-3xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 p-4 sm:p-6 text-white backdrop:bg-slate-950/85">
      <div class="flex justify-end mb-3"><button type="button" data-cat-close class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-600 text-slate-200 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-200 cursor-pointer bg-transparent">{{ H.cat.close }} <span aria-hidden="true">✕</span></button></div>
      {%- include "cat-player.njk" %}
    </dialog>

    {# ══════ 2 GALLERY — real apps, one large, the others beside it ══════ #}
    {#- Without JavaScript: radio inputs switch the stage (home.css, :checked ~). All stages are in the HTML; only one is
        shown. The caption is one line. The thumbnails are examples, which the label and the catalog button say. -#}
    {%- set G = L.gallery %}
    <section id="{{ G.id }}" class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20 scroll-mt-16" aria-labelledby="gallery-heading">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 id="gallery-heading" class="font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-8" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4.5vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.15;">{{ G.heading }}</h2>
        <div class="gal" role="group" aria-label="{{ G.heading }}">
          {%- for a in G.apps %}
          <input type="radio" name="gallery" id="gal-{{ loop.index0 }}" aria-label="{{ a.title }}"{% if loop.first %} checked{% endif %}>
          {%- endfor %}
          <div class="gal-stage">
            {%- for a in G.apps %}
            <div class="gal-panel">
              <div class="gal-frame">
                <div class="gal-win"><div class="gal-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><picture>{% if a.dark %}<source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="{{ ('/media/apps/' + a.id + '-desktop-dark.webp') | own }}">{% endif %}<img src="{{ ('/media/apps/' + a.id + '-desktop.webp') | own }}" alt="{{ a.altDesktop }}" width="1280" height="800" loading="lazy"></picture></div>
                <div class="gal-phone"><picture>{% if a.dark %}<source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="{{ ('/media/apps/' + a.id + '-phone-dark.webp') | own }}">{% endif %}<img src="{{ ('/media/apps/' + a.id + '-phone.webp') | own }}" alt="{{ a.altPhone }}" width="780" height="1560" loading="lazy"></picture></div>
              </div>
              <p class="gal-cap"><a href="{{ a.href | own }}" class="font-bold text-slate-900 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-700">{{ a.title }}</a> · {{ a.line }}</p>
            </div>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
          <div class="gal-side">
            <p class="gal-eg">{{ G.label }}</p>
            <div class="gal-thumbs">
              {%- for a in G.apps %}
              <label for="gal-{{ loop.index0 }}"><picture>{% if a.dark %}<source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="{{ ('/media/apps/' + a.id + '-desktop-dark.webp') | own }}">{% endif %}<img src="{{ ('/media/apps/' + a.id + '-desktop.webp') | own }}" alt="" width="1280" height="800"></picture><span>{{ a.title }}<small>{{ a.field }}</small></span></label>
              {%- endfor %}
            </div>
            <a href="{{ G.moreHref | own }}" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-400 text-slate-900 font-semibold hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">{{ G.more }} →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ══════ 3 FOR YOU — teacher, parent, test coming up ══════ #}
    {%- set F = L.forYou %}
    <section id="{{ F.id }}" class="bg-slate-50 py-16 sm:py-20 scroll-mt-16" aria-labelledby="foryou-heading">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 id="foryou-heading" class="font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-8" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4.5vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.15;">{{ F.heading }}</h2>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-x-10 gap-y-8 list-none p-0 m-0">
          {%- for s in F.items %}
          <li class="border-t-2 border-slate-300 pt-5">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg leading-snug mb-2">{{ s.headline }}</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">{{ s.text }}</p>
            <a href="{{ s.ctaHref | own }}" class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-800">{{ s.cta }} →</a>
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        {#- Privacy is a feature: one line, with the notice that teachers pass on to their school. #}
        <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-slate-600">{{ F.privacy.text }} <a href="{{ F.privacy.href | own }}" class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-800 whitespace-nowrap">{{ F.privacy.link }} →</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ══════ 4 AI — the learner's own tutor, in one sentence; details on /tutor/ ══════ #}
    {%- set K = L.ki %}
    <section id="{{ K.id }}" class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20 scroll-mt-16" aria-labelledby="ki-heading">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 id="ki-heading" class="font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-4" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4.5vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.15;">{{ K.heading | marked | safe }}</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-4" style="font-size: 1.0625rem;">{{ K.text }}</p>
        <a href="{{ K.ctaHref | own }}" class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-800">{{ K.cta }} →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ══════ 5 FOR MAKERS — joining and the foundation ══════ #}
    {%- set M = L.maker %}
    <section id="{{ M.id }}" class="bg-slate-50 py-16 sm:py-20 scroll-mt-16" aria-labelledby="maker-heading">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 id="maker-heading" class="font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-8" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4.5vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.15;">{{ M.heading | marked | safe }}</h2>
        <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-6 m-0 mb-6 max-w-3xl">
          {%- for col in [M.you, M.we] %}
          <div class="border-t-2 border-slate-300 pt-5"><dt class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-1">{{ col.title }}</dt><dd class="m-0 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">{{ col.text }}</dd></div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </dl>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">{{ M.note }}</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
          <a href="{{ M.ctaHref | own }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-400 text-slate-900 font-semibold hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">{{ M.cta }} →</a>
          <a href="{{ M.linkHref | own }}" class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-800">{{ M.link }} →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ══════ 6 PLATFORM — it belongs to no company ══════ #}
    {%- set P = L.platform %}
    <section id="{{ P.id }}" class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20 scroll-mt-16" aria-labelledby="platform-heading">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 id="platform-heading" class="font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-8" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4.5vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.15;">{{ P.heading | marked | safe }}</h2>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-x-10 gap-y-6 list-none p-0 m-0 mb-8">
          {%- for pt in P.points %}
          <li class="border-t-2 border-slate-300 pt-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-1">{{ pt.title }}</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">{{ pt.text }}</p></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        <a href="{{ P.linkHref | own }}" class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-800">{{ P.link }} →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ══════ 7 FOUNDER — a person stands behind it ══════ #}
    {%- set W = L.founder %}
    <section class="bg-slate-50 py-16 sm:py-20" aria-label="{{ W.signature }}">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
        <figure class="m-0 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-6 sm:pl-8">
          <blockquote class="m-0"><p class="text-slate-800 leading-relaxed" style="font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.625rem); line-height: 1.4;">{{ W.quote }}</p></blockquote>
          <figcaption class="mt-5"><span class="block font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ W.signature }}</span><span class="text-sm text-slate-500">{{ W.role }}</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <a href="{{ W.linkHref | own }}" class="mt-6 inline-block font-semibold text-blue-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-800">{{ W.link }} →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ══════ FINAL CTA ══════ #}
    <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-blue-700 text-white" aria-labelledby="final-cta-heading">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h2 id="final-cta-heading" class="font-bold mb-8" style="font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);">{{ L.cta.title }}</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="{{ L.cta.primaryHref | own }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-white text-blue-700 font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors text-sm">{{ L.cta.primary }} →</a>
          <a href="{{ L.cta.secondaryHref | own }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors text-sm border border-blue-500">{{ L.cta.secondary }}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  {% laFooter page.url %}
  </div>
  <script src="{{ '/cat.js' | own }}" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
